OL,3,GNEWSATruck fire spreads to motorway
OL,4,Averge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire that engulfed a truck on a
OL,7,Fmotorway has spread to vegetation on
OL,8,Fthe side of the road, causing long
OL,9,Ftraffic delays.
OL,11,FFire crews were called at about 13:00
OL,12,FBST to the westbound M4 between
OL,13,Fjunctions 12 (Reading West) and 13
OL,14,F(Newbury) in Berkshire.
OL,16,FTwo lanes were closed westbound and
OL,17,Ftraffic was held temporarily due to
OL,18,Fsmoke, National Highways said.
OL,20,FIt has reported delays of 70 minutes
OL,21,Fwestbound but no problems for eastbound
OL,22,Ftraffic.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
